  "solution": "**Symbols**\n\n \n \n \n+\n\n \n \n \n-\n\n \n \n \n×\n\n \n \n \n÷\n\n \n \n \n\n \n \n**Meaning**\n\n \n \n \n-\n\n \n \n \n×\n\n \n \n \n÷\n\n \n \n \n+\n\n \n \n \n\nGiven equation: 12 × 3 - 25 ÷ 25 + 25 = ?\n\nAfter replacing the symbols by their meaning, we get:\n\n__**12 ÷**____** 3**__ × 25 + 25 - 25 = ?\n\n⇒ __**4**____** ×**____** 25**__ + 25 - 25 = ?\n\n⇒ __**100**____** + 25**__** **- 25 = ?\n\n⇒ __**125 - 25**__ = ?\n\n⇒ 100 = ?\n\nHence, '**100**' is the correct answer.",
